---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { APP_URL } from '../lib/app-url';
---

<SiteLayout
  pageTitle="About the Non-Profit Behind Virtue"
  tagline="Providing free tools and resources for accountability"
  description="The Virtue Initiative is a non-profit that provides free, open source accountability tools. Read our mission and why we built Virtue."
>
  <section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative is an organization that aims to provide free tools and resources for
      accountability. We currently offer a free screenshot-based accountability app and some
      resources on how to use it well.
    </p>

    <div class="about-callout">
      <p>
        Our mission is to develop free technology and resources to support people who want to be
        free from pornography. We know what it is like to feel stuck, and we want to provide tools
        to support you. We do not want the price to be yet another excuse not to deal with
        pornography.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Our vision</h2>

    <p>
      Our vision is to see the Christian church and the world freed from pornography. There are
      billions of dollars made by keeping men and women stuck. For many people, it starts from a
      young age, and it is hard to give up, even if they desperately want to. We want to provide
      tools that support you and make it easier.
    </p>

    <h2>Our story</h2>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative began in February 2026 when we started looking at accountability apps.
      There were a few options but none of them were free. We thought, &quot;What if we can make a
      free version while keeping most of the essential features of other paid services?&quot; Our
      goal is to fundraise all our financial support and keep the app free.
    </p>

    <h2>How can you help?</h2>

    <p>We are still early in the project, and there are a few things you can do to help.</p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong><a href={`${APP_URL}/signup`}>Install the app</a></strong>. Even if you do not
        struggle with pornography, installing the app and giving us feedback is one of the most
        helpful things right now. We need to know what works well and what does not so that we can
        improve it.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="/donate">Donate</a></strong>. We are not a 501(c)(3) yet, so donations are
        not tax deductible. We are working toward 501(c)(3) status, but getting it is expensive
        (lawyers, filing fees, etc.). If you are able and want to support our mission, we could use
        some money to help get this off the ground.
        <div class="about-note">
          <p>
            Note: We are organized as a nonprofit in New York and have a board, so we are required
            to operate as a nonprofit and must use any funds we receive to further our mission, but
            you cannot write off donations as tax deductible yet (which only matters if you do not
            take the standard deduction).
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Tell others about the app</strong>. The core app is already built, but the biggest
        challenge will likely be helping people learn that there is a free option. We do not want
        cost to be the reason people do not take the first step, so tell them about it!
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Get your church or organization involved</strong>. We want to partner with churches
        and other organizations. If your organization is interested in partnering with us, feel free
        to reach out at <a href="mailto:partner@virtueinitiative.org"
          >partner@virtueinitiative.org</a
        >.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Pray for us</strong>. Little will change without prayer. Pray that people would be
        freed from pornography and that we would be able to provide the tools to help them.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p>
      If you are struggling yourself, <a href="/help/tips">our tips to beat pornography</a> are a good
      place to start.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>

    <p>
      If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at <a
        href="mailto:help@virtueinitiative.org">help@virtueinitiative.org</a
      > or join our <a href="https://discord.gg/4kNsbRuzQD">Discord server</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
  #about h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 1.95rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: var(--text);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  #about p,
  #about li {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  #about p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  #about h2 + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  #about h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  #about ol + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  #about ol {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  #about li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-note {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .about-note p {
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    font-size: 1rem !important;
    line-height: 1.7 !important;
  }

  .about-callout {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .about-callout p {
    font-size: 1.12rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text) !important;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.85 !important;
  }
</style>
